text:
The plate holds 6 maki roll pieces, about 30-35 g each, so roughly 190 g. The fillings look like salmon and cucumber, with some avocado and pepper. Sushi rice runs about 1.3 kcal/g with filling, so around 1.4 kcal/g overall gives roughly 260 kcal.

The ginger and wasabi sit in separate cups, not on the plate. Counting them would add about 15 g of ginger (~5 kcal) and 5 g of wasabi (~5 kcal), but I'm leaving them out of the plate estimate.

{"kcal": 260, "mass_g": 190}
